# Git & releases (ClipForge)

- Never force-push `main`. Never amend/rebase commits already on `origin/main`.
- Always `git fetch origin` before branch/rebase/PR. Sync local `main` to `origin/main` first.
- If `main` and a feature branch have no merge-base, stop and ask the human.
- Force-push only the current feature branch after an explicit rebase, with `--force-with-lease`.
- Conventional Commits only. Do not hand-bump versions or rewrite CHANGELOG for routine releases.
- Do not push tags/releases unless asked. See `AGENTS.md` (hard rules at the top).
